 "summary": "Seven glass-passivated standard rectifier diodes in the DO-214AA (SMB) package, each rated 3.0 A average forward current and 100 A surge. Reverse ratings run from 50 V (S3AB) to 1000 V (S3MB); forward voltage is 1.0 V maximum at 3 A for every member. Intended uses: power supplies, inverters, converters and freewheeling diodes.",
